ates, bottles and plants sit on every table, counter and shelf on both floors. Knock them to the floor and fill the chaos meter before time runs out.\n\nGRANNY\nShe hears every crash, stomps over with her broom and talks the whole time. Get up high - she can't reach you on the shelves.\n\nPLAY ONLINE OR WITH BOTS\nQuick Match with players around the world, make a private room with a 4-digit code for friends, or play with bots any time. Empty seats fill with bots, so a game always starts. Up to 8 cats in a room.\n\nNINE CATS\nGinger, silver tabby, black, snow white, tuxedo, calico, Russian blue, brown tabby and a Sphynx. Earn fish coins for tags, crashes and wins.\n\nThirteen rooms in bright colours upstairs and down. Mute, block and report players at any time. Voice chat is off until you turn it on. Music on/off with volume, sound effects volume. English.", "short_description": "Be a cat and run on your own front paws through a big, bright house. Play feral tag online or with bots, team up to wreck Granny's house, and stay out of reach of her broom."}]}, "developer_name": "Citiview Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/catclub/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Citiview Studios", "support_website_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/catclub/", "website_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/catclub/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCU